# 仓库和工作区一律 LF，Windows / Mac 检出结果相同：不依赖各机器的 core.autocrlf，
# 否则 Windows 上会检出 CRLF，prettier / ESLint 改一次换行就把整个文件算成改动
* text=auto eol=lf

# git 钩子由 git 直接 spawn，Windows 上 CRLF 会导致 shebang 解析失败（Exec format error）
/.husky/* text eol=lf

# cmd.exe 按 CRLF 解析批处理，LF 会让 goto / 标签错位
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制显式标出，不交给 text=auto 猜，避免被当文本改换行而损坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.jar binary
*.exe binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
/electron/ffmpeg/ffmpeg-* binary
